OL,3,CTourist, 30, dies after being struck
OL,4,Cby lightning while hiking Mount Etna
OL,6,FAn American tourist has been killed by
OL,7,Fa lightning strike on Mount Etna in
OL,8,FSicily over the weekend, according to
OL,9,Flocal officials.
OL,11,FThe 30-year-old man from Kansas was
OL,12,Fhiking in an area that was closed to
OL,13,Fvisitors due to recent volcanic
OL,14,Factivity, Italian firefighters said
OL,15,FMonday.
OL,17,FA helicopter found him on Sunday at
OL,18,Faround 8pm local time after he had
OL,19,Fbeen hit by a bolt of lightning when a
OL,20,Fpowerful thunderstorm broke out.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/4
