OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787050071
OL,3,CTourist, 30, dies after being struck
OL,4,Cby lightning while hiking Mount Etna
OL,6,FFirefighters and emergency services
OL,7,Fsaid he was in a state of cardiac
OL,8,Farrest in an exposed area above the
OL,9,Ftree line.
OL,11,FThe man, who was not identified, was
OL,12,Flater declared dead by medical
OL,13,Fpersonnel at Cannizzaro Hospital in
OL,14,FCatania.
OL,16,FAccording to local media, the male had
OL,17,Fentered an area designated as off-
OL,18,Flimits to hikers, apparently in an
OL,19,Feffort to get closer to the summit of
OL,20,Fthe active volcano.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/4
