OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F318A1787050071
OL,3,CTourist, 30, dies after being struck
OL,4,Cby lightning while hiking Mount Etna
OL,6,FOfficials said that more people have
OL,7,Fdied on Etna from lightning strikes
OL,8,Fover recent decades than from volcanic
OL,9,Factivity.
OL,11,FThe last eruption-related fatalities
OL,12,Fon Europe's tallest and one of the
OL,13,Fworld's most active volcanoes were in
OL,14,F1987.
OL,16,FAbout 1.5 million people visit Etna
OL,17,Fevery year.
